        "bullet_point": [
          {
            "value": "🌷【UNIQUE SHAPE】The surface of the ceramic vase is unglazed frosted texture, the hollow center design and white color add a modern geometric beauty to your home decoration, the unique shape reflects the simple European and bohemian style, and can be integrated with any home decoration.",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          },
          {
            "value": "🌷【VASE SIZE】You will receive a beautiful white ceramic vase, it is handmade, it matches your home decor perfectly, the vase size is 7.08''*6.7''*1.3'', the dimensions are all measured by hand, So there may be some small deviations.",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          },
          {
            "value": "🌷【Applicable Scenes】This rustic ceramic frosted vase is suitable for living room, bedroom, dining table, bathroom, office, bookshelf, mantelpiece, etc. It's also a great gift for wedding housewarmings and holidays, adding some simplicity.",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          },
          {
            "value": "🌷【Design Concept】This hollow ceramic flower vase is made with a bisque crafting The surface is unglazed matte texture，Although it comes in different sizes, it is essential for your interior decoration and can be matched with any dried flower pampas grass. It is not only a vase, but a piece artwork.",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          },
          {
            "value": "🌷【Worry-free after sale】We provide 100% customer service to make sure you get the perfect home decoration vase, if you don't like it, please contact us, we will provide you with a satisfactory solution.",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          }
        ],
        "item_package_quantity": [
