          }
        ],
        "product_description": [
          {
            "value": "Looking for a decor piece to compliment your vanity, coffee table or dining table? Look no further! This is a gorgeous, stylish and heavy-weighted centerpiece. The minimalist design and soft, neutral color ensure that this Elegant decor accent will fit in seamlessly with your current interior design theme. It exudes a simplistic, carefree style and will help transform any room in and around your home. Add a touch of modern Art into any room around your apartment, house, dorm, or office. The Face Design Flower Vase is an excellent addition to a living room, kitchen, bedroom, mantle, desk, coffee table, and any other place you want to add a subtle, chic touch.",
